  - m_Id: 10165967704563712
    m_Localized: 'Falling

      Falling can be interrupted by jumping, dashing,
      or shifting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10165966886674432
    m_Localized: 'Element Skill

      After accumulating 6 stacks, hold down the
      lower button to use the Element Skill.

      Fire and Wind have different
      effects.


      Controller: RB

      Keyboard: F'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10165968623116288
    m_Localized: 'Element

      Dashing can change your element, lasting for 5 seconds.

      Dashing
      forward changes to Fire, dashing backward changes to Wind.

      Shooting
      enemies in this state will collect skill elements.


      Controller: B

      Keyboard:
      Shift'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10166319581503488
    m_Localized: 'Element Jump

      Consumes three points of element energy to
      use Element Jump.


      Controller: Y

      Keyboard: Q'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
